riti confirm wa document for the t011 releas evid pack clickup task ciph 22 sourc id src cu ciph 22 task id ciph 22 titl cli api pariti verif status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 07 09 activ histori 2026 07 09 bob task creat open task open to verifi pariti between the cli and the rest api 2026 07 20 bob document cli api pariti confirm for releas pack complet\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e971cec28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-22-CLI-API-Parity.md\", \"id\": \"db78d250fb199f85\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.3161752707554354, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.15496181536490772, \"vector_similarity\": 0.69234, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-22-CLI-API-Parity.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e971cec28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-22-CLI-API-Parity.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-22-CLI-API-Parity.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1051, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:35\", \"token_count\": 566, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"**Source ID**: SRC-MEET-10\\n\\n# Fireflies Transcript: Pre-Release Audit\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-09-15\\n\\n**Participants**: Alice (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Diana (QA), Evan (DevOps)\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nPre-release gate review: Docker slim/CVE, Windows signing, and upstream high-DPI remain open. Audit-log path still a hold — CLI schema and emitted records don't match.\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-MEET-10\\n\\n# Fireflies Transcript: Pre-Release Audit\\n\\n**Date**: 2026-09-15\\n\\n**Participants**: Alice (PM), Bob (Backend), Charlie (Engine), Di