50a168a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-30-PII-Pattern-Update-HIPAA.md\", \"id\": \"4bf617ddf1604b2e\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.2921566699851591, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.11715764426451306, \"vector_similarity\": 0.70048773, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-30-PII-Pattern-Update-HIPAA.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e9650a168a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-30-PII-Pattern-Update-HIPAA.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-30-PII-Pattern-Update-HIPAA.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1105, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:17\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:02:47\", \"token_count\": 527, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-27\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Title**: Conflict Resolution\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Alice\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-12\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nDefine how the redaction engine resolves conflicts when multiple policy rules overlap on the same content. The team implemented a union rule for overlapping policies, recorded the decision as durable compliance evidence, and later regression-checked it against the HIPAA pattern update work to confirm the merge still holds.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-27\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-27\\n\\n**Title**: Conflict Resolution\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Alice\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-12\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Overlapping-policy conflicts resolve deterministically using the union rule.\\n\\n- Union rule decision is recorded in the compliance pack as durable evi