ynth/tasks/CIPH-27-Conflict-Resolution.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-27-Conflict-Resolution.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1547, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:00\", \"token_count\": 586, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- **2026-08-01**: Diana - Regression Check (Completed)\\n\\n - *Regression-checked the conflict-resolution rule against the new HIPAA pattern updates to confirm the completed union merge wasn't broken.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"2026 0801 diana regress check complet regress check the conflict resolut rule against the new hipaa pattern updat to confirm the complet union merg wasn t broken\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"e956a8b88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-27-Conflict-Resolution.md\", \"id\": \"2607e259ea8d5dde\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.29094384234371184, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.10175563191958838, \"vector_similarity\": 0.732383, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-27-Conflict-Resolution.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e956a8b88a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-27-Conflict-Resolution.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/tasks/CIPH-27-Conflict-Resolution.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1547, \"chunk_count\": 2, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:00\", \"token_count\": 586, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nImplement fail-closed behavior for the batch engine so a processing failure never releases an unredacted output file (WS-04). Bob completed the implementation on 2026-06-15. On 2026-07-16 Diana's QA pass validated the fail-closed behavior - confirming no output file is produced on failure and that temp files are securely deleted - ahead of the encryption (T021) and offline-mode (T027) work that depends on it.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Fail-closed implementation completed (2026-06-15).\\n\\n- QA-validated: no output file produced on failure, and temp files are securely deleted.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nImplement fail-closed behavior for the batch engine so a processing failure never releases an unredacted output file (WS-04). Bob completed the implementation on 2026-06-15. On 2026-07-16 Diana's QA pass validated the fail-closed behavior - confirming no output file is produced on failure and that temp files are securely deleted - ahead of the encryption (T021) and offline-mode (T027) work that depends on it.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-25\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-25\\n\\n**Title**: Batch Processing Fail-Closed Strategy\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-06-08\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup tas