ity\": 0.32229376043651997, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.1386641720521714, \"vector_similarity\": 0.7507628, \"dataset_name\": \"C1Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-license-audit.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"e90df4e28a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-license-audit.md\", \"location\": \"med-synth/communication/sources/slack/2026-08-09-license-audit.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 1085, \"chunk_count\": 1, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:42:16\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:03:57\", \"token_count\": 310, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"d13efb7c8a9a11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"# ClickUp Task: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-40\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Title**: Audit third-party licenses before release\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAudit third-party licenses across the dependency tree before release. An initial audit led to swapping the PDF parser library, but the task was reopened when the replacement parser turned out to be AGPL-licensed; the team is now searching for an Apache/MIT-licensed alternative.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-40\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Title**: Audit third-party licenses before release\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- Full dependency tree is audited for license compliance.\\n\\n- No restrictive copyleft (e.g., AGPL) licenses remain in the shipped dependency set.\\n\\n- Apache/MIT-licensed PDF parser alternative is identified and adopted, resolving the reopened AGPL finding.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-40\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Title**: Audit third-party licenses before release\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nAudit third-party licenses across the dependency tree before release. An initial audit led to swapping the PDF parser library, but the task was reopened when the replacement parser turned out to be AGPL-licensed; the team is now searching for an Apache/MIT-licensed alternative.\\n\\n# ClickUp Task: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Source ID**: SRC-CU-CIPH-40\\n\\n**Task ID**: CIPH-40\\n\\n**Title**: Audit third-party licenses before release\\n\\n**Status**: Active (Reopened)\\n\\n**Assignee**: Diana\\n\\n**Priority**: High\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-08\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-08**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task for a license compliance review ahead of release.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-15**: Charlie - Apache/MIT Search (Active (Reopened))\\n\\n - *Searching for an Apache/MIT-licensed alternative PDF parser after the task was reopened when the replacement parser turned out to be AGPL-licensed.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 40 sourc id src cu ciph 40 task id ciph 40 titl audit third parti licens befor releas status activ reopen assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 descript audit third parti licens across the depend tree befor releas an initi audit led to swap the pdf parser librari but the task wa reopen when the replac parser turn out to be agpl licens the team is now search for an apach mit licens altern clickup task ciph 40 sourc id src cu ciph 40 task id ciph 40 titl audit third parti licens befor releas status activ reopen assigne diana prioriti high date creat 2026 08 08 accept criterion full depend tree is audit for licens complianc no restrict copyleft e g agpl licens remain in the ship depend set apach mit licens pdf parser altern is identifi and adopt resolv the reopen agpl find clickup task ciph 40 sourc id src cu c